{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107523","id":2592371280,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ahHJQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107523","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107523.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107523.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107523","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107523/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107523/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107523/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ff91530af9f9d7316337b95692e0d4a32c1a7cee","number":107523,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Create `AudioStreamWithEffects`","user":{"login":"RoyBerardo","id":32561682,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTYxNjgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32561682?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo","html_url":"https://github.com/RoyBerardo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This adds a new `AudioStream` type, ~~`AudioStreamEffect`~~ `AudioStreamWithEffects`, which applies audio bus effects directly to audio streams.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/05f46a57-cfe3-4612-8a06-ec5b4c9c896b)\r\n\r\nThis partially addresses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/8190 (\"Partially\" because i believe it would be useful to apply effects to audio stream players, but that is a whole other topic)\r\n\r\nEffects can be individually bypassed. By enabling `process_bypassed_effects`, bypassed effects will still process so bypassing and un-bypassing effects like reverb won't result in a burst of sound.\r\n\r\nWhen the child stream is finished playing, this stream fades out for the duration of `tail_time`, allowing effects like reverb and delay to fade out.\r\n\r\nThis is currently a draft because I feel it would be useful to get community input on this new stream type. Some things I'd like to get some thoughts/discussion on in particular:\r\n\r\n- Should `process_bypassed_effects` be per-effect? That would allow for more granular control but I worry about cluttering the effect list. UPDATE: Decided to make it per-effect.\r\n- Instead of `tail_fade_curve`, should there instead just be a bool that simply enables/disables a fade on the tail? UPDATE: Decided to keep the curve.\r\n- Would appreciate it if someone looked over the docs I made, I'm not the best at writing those.\r\n- AudioEffect docs would need to be updated since they talk about audio effects only in the context of busses.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":823